tillo and Rodrigo Rêgo are also out besides Brignani, and today's Castellón Plaza preview says a virus has hit several players, with the coach deciding on them at the last minute, while Matías Orozco is back from Colombia duty. Eldense lose captain Jesús Clemente (dislocated shoulder) and Fidel Chaves (muscle problem), neither counted by the numbers, while Guirao is fit again; Javi Calleja plans to press man-to-man, contest possession and take risks. It is a regional match with a tribute to Jesús de Miguel, and referee Pablo Morales Moreno is slightly below average on cards.","goals":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-8,"call":"Around 2.6 goals","text":"The numbers say 2.8 goals, 2.0 of them for Castellón. I lean lower because Israel Suero, scorer of a quarter of Castellón's league goals, is out and the numbers don't know it, and today's preview adds a virus in the Castellón squad; Eldense are also without Fidel Chaves and Castellón's defence has conceded only 5 in 13, so I go 8% lower, to about 2.6 (a point more than before because of the virus)."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 9.5 corners","text":"The numbers say 9.5 corners and already trim Eldense for 19 corners in their last six. Castellón are one of the sides that keep the ball most and should still pin Eldense back even without Suero, while Eldense's plan to contest possession cuts the other way, so I stay at 9.5."},"cards":{"lean":"higher","adjust_pct":3,"call":"Around 5.5 cards","text":"The numbers say 5.3 cards: they add a lot for Eldense's recent cards (20 in six) and take a little off for referee Pablo Morales Moreno (4.6 a game in 7 games). I lean slightly higher to about 5.5 because it is a regional match the numbers do not flag as a derby and Calleja wants aggressive man-to-man pressing all over the pitch, which tends to bring fouls."},"shots":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-4,"call":"About 23.6 shots","text":"The numbers say 24.6 shots and already trim Castellón for a quieter recent spell. Without Suero, and with a virus going through the squad, Castellón lose some of their attacking edge, and Eldense will try to slow the game by contesting the ball, so I trim 4%, to about 23.6."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-6,"call":"About 8.2 on target","text":"The numbers say 8.7 shots on target. Suero's absence matters most here, since he is the player who turns Castellón's possession into efforts on goal, and the reported virus may weaken their attack further, so I lower it 6%, to about 8.2."},"sources":["https://castellonplaza.com/castellonplaza/deportes4966/el-castellon-se-reencuentra-con-su-aficion-en-busca-de-una-nueva-victoria","https://castellonplaza.com/castellonplaza/deportes4966/pablo-hernandez-va-a-ser-una-tarde-especial-por-los-homenajes-a-jesus-de-miguel","https://alicanteplaza.es/alicanteplaza/deportesalicante/calleja-quiere-que-el-cd-eldense-sea-el-primero-en-ganar-en-castalia-vamos-sin-complejos-y-convencidos-de-que-podemos-ganar","https://alicanteplaza.es/alicanteplaza/deportesalicante/se-abre-el-debate-respecto-a-la-zaga-del-cd-eldense","https://www.laliga.com/es-CO/partido/temporada-2026-2027-laliga-hypermotion-cd-castellon-cd-eldense-15"],"written_at":"2026-11-21T16:11:58Z"},"league":"segunda-division","take":{"applied":true,"written_at":"2026-11-21T16:11:58Z","goals":{"home":1.836,"away":0.781,"total":2.617,"adjust_pct":-8.0,"sized":true,"lean":"lower","home_win":0.609,"draw":0.253,"away_win":0.138,"over":{"1.5":0.752,"2.5":0.486,"3.5":0.268},"over_show":{"0.5":0.911,"1.5":0.752,"2.5":0.486,"3.5":0.268,"4.5":0.125},"btts":0.471,"likely_scores":[{"score":"2-0","p":0.123},{"score":"1-1","p":0.12},{"score":"1-0","p":0.118},{"score":"2-1","p":0.096},{"score":"0-0","p":0.089}],"clean_sheet_home":0.458,"clean_sheet_away":0.159,"range":[1,5],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"0.5","p":0.911,"shown":true},"under":{"line":"4.5","p":0.875,"shown":true}}},"corners":{"home":5.744,"away":3.738,"total":9.482,"adjust_pct":0.0,"sized":tr